import{_ as i,o as n,c as a,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const h=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 419 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Myriad-Races Republican Plan: Breaking Human-Centeredness and Racial Discrimination","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 419 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Myriad-Races Republican Plan: Breaking Human-Centeredness and Racial Discrimination","no":419,"module":2,"tags":["Manghuang Ji","Myriad-Races Republicanism","Human-Centeredness","Racial Discrimination","Demon Tribes"],"related":["05-Myriad-Ranks Joint Progress Basic Program","50-Myriad-Races Genealogy Overview","52-Alien Classification and Symbiosis"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0419_模块2-莽荒纪-万族共和方案-打破人族本位与种族歧视.md","filePath":"en/0419_模块2-莽荒纪-万族共和方案-打破人族本位与种族歧视.md"}'),s={name:"en/0419_模块2-莽荒纪-万族共和方案-打破人族本位与种族歧视.md"};function o(r,e,l,c,d,u){return n(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-419-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-myriad-races-republican-plan-breaking-human-centeredness-and-racial-discrimination" tabindex="-1">Entry 419 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Myriad-Races Republican Plan: Breaking Human-Centeredness and Racial Discrimination <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-419-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-myriad-races-republican-plan-breaking-human-centeredness-and-racial-discrimination" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 419 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Myriad-Races Republican Plan: Breaking Human-Centeredness and Racial Discrimination&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Manghuang Ji Full Decomposition (Entry 24) | Benchmark base: Documents 05, 50, 52</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-manghuang-s-demon-tribes-are-not-even-a-race-only-medicinal-herbs" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Manghuang&#39;s demon tribes are not even a &quot;race,&quot; only medicinal herbs <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-manghuang-s-demon-tribes-are-not-even-a-race-only-medicinal-herbs" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Manghuang&#39;s demon tribes are not even a &quot;race,&quot; only medicinal herbs&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the <strong>republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong> is this entry&#39;s core — all beings have equal evolution qualification, Myriad Ranks 99% full coverage, breaking strong ones&#39; monopoly of knowledge and the Great Dao. Manghuang&#39;s world&#39;s racial structure is typical &quot;human-centeredness&quot;: demon tribes, alien beasts, plant spirits are either body-refining material or barbarians to conquer, never treated as equal evolution subjects. This entry prescribes medicine: Myriad-Races Republican Plan. The law-first axiom is core. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = high-leaning-medium. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Human-centeredness&#39;s energy waste lies in &quot;Myriad Ranks&#39; potential buried&quot;: among demon tribes, bloodlines that could have produced strong ones are refined into Ji Ning&#39;s muscles under the &quot;material&quot; definition; plant spirits, planet consciousness do not exist in Manghuang&#39;s worldview at all. <strong>Treating Myriad Ranks as a mine to dig equals burning an entire race&#39;s evolutionary potential to ash in one go.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How human-centeredness manufactures regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Myriad Ranks&#39; potential wasted</strong>: demon-tribe strong-one seedlings refined into material; civilization loses future middle tier</li><li><strong>Racial hatred accumulates</strong>: humankind long squeezes demon tribes; in great war demon tribes surely rebel; civilization internal friction</li><li><strong>Knowledge single</strong>: only one humankind cultivation path; demon-tribe ecological wisdom ignored</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The predatory jurisprudence behind human-centeredness:</p><ul><li><strong>&quot;The other as material&quot;</strong>: demon tribes in the narrative are not beings, but body-refining herbs — the most naked species predation</li><li><strong>Human exception</strong>: all &quot;ownerless goods go to the capable&quot; rules only apply to non-humans</li><li><strong>Ji Ning&#39;s blind spot</strong>: he values loyalty and affection, but affection only to human relatives and friends; demon tribes never entered his moral circle</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Manghuang Human-Centeredness</th><th>Myriad-Races Republican Plan</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Demon tribes = body-refining material</td><td>Demon tribes = equal evolution race; Myriad-Ranks differentiated cultivation paths</td></tr><tr><td>Plant spirits / planet consciousness nonexistent</td><td>Five Myriad-Ranks genealogy full coverage: energy races, consciousness races both have roads</td></tr><tr><td>Cultivation path one shop only</td><td>300 Origin systems open to Myriad Ranks</td></tr><tr><td>Racial hatred accumulates</td><td>Myriad-Ranks republican co-build; break strong-one monopoly</td></tr><tr><td>Strong one defines &quot;the other&quot;</td><td>Symbiotic Court adjudicates racial relations; not by fists</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: inject Myriad-Races Republican Plan into Manghuang&#39;s world; demon tribes from &quot;material&quot; promoted to equal race</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: compare &quot;human-centeredness&quot; vs. &quot;Myriad-Races republicanism&quot; two racial policies</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: demon-tribe strong-one talent-rate, racial-conflict frequency, civilization overall path diversity</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: quantified conclusion — under the republican plan demon-tribe talent-rate rises from near-zero to a substantial level; racial-conflict frequency significantly drops</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Before installation self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. &quot;Other as material&quot; ethical rules swing with plot</li><li><strong>After installation self-consistency: high</strong>. Racial relations legislated; rules recomputable</li><li><strong>After installation retcon-ending risk: low</strong></li><li><strong>After installation protagonist uniqueness dependency: extremely low</strong>. Myriad-Races republicanism does not hang on humankind&#39;s single top</li></ul><p>Myriad-Races republicanism also has an often-overlooked dimension: ecological wisdom. Demon tribes are not just another kind of human; they represent a survival wisdom completely different from humankind — symbiosis with nature, inheritance by bloodline, cultivation by instinct. Manghuang wiped out this wisdom as barbarism, equal to cutting off an arm. Myriad-Races republicanism is not almsgiving to demon tribes, but humankind itself needs demon tribes&#39; wisdom to complete the cultivation system. Treating demon tribes as friends, humankind itself can avoid several hundred years of detours.</p><p>Myriad-Races republicanism&#39;s gains are also in innovation. When humankind alone dominates, the cultivation system has only one road; after Myriad-Races republicanism, demon tribes&#39; bloodlines, plant spirits&#39; circulation, consciousness races&#39; deduction all become new routes. Civilization&#39;s innovation rate is proportional to how many races it contains.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: Myriad Ranks&#39; evolutionary potential from &quot;burned to ash&quot; to &quot;cultivated to talent&quot;</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: abolish &quot;other as material&quot;; establish racial equality</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo only benefits humankind; this plan directly pulls Myriad Ranks into the equal circle</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: demon tribes, plant spirits, planet consciousness 99% have roads</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the wider Myriad-Ranks genealogy coverage, the more risk-resistant civilization</li></ul><p>Myriad-Races republicanism also has a technical gain: Myriad Races&#39; respective talents can be assembled into a complementary cultivation system. Demon tribes excel at body and bloodline; humankind excels at deduction and institutions; plant spirits excel at energy circulation; consciousness races excel at law deduction. Manghuang wastes these talents on mutual hunting; Heng Yuan Zhou assembles them into a complete system. Myriad-Races republicanism is not political correctness, but the cultivation system itself needs Myriad Ranks.</p><p>Myriad-Races republicanism also has an overlooked dimension: it multiplies civilization&#39;s resilience. A single-race civilization is done once extinct; a Myriad-Races-symbiotic civilization has one race in trouble and other races backfill.</p><p>Myriad-Races republicanism is not a slogan, but the civilizational optimum proven by practice.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>What Manghuang does most cruelly to demon tribes is not fighting and killing, but fundamentally not treating them as a &quot;race.&quot; The Myriad-Races Republican Plan&#39;s essence is releasing demon tribes from the medicine cabinet — letting them also have qualification to cultivate, qualification to evolve, qualification to enter civilization&#39;s builder ranks. A civilization that only benefits humankind, however strong, is incomplete.</p><p>In the final analysis, Manghuang Ji · Myriad-Races Republican Plan · breaking human-centeredness and racial discrimination described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./418_模块2-莽荒纪-阿赖耶监管方案-杜绝修仙掠夺的制度设计.html">Entry 418 · Alaya Supervision Plan</a> · <a href="./427_模块2-莽荒纪-异族处境-妖族被定义为资源的悲剧.html">Entry 427 · Alien Situation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/05-万族共进基本纲领.html">05-Myriad-Ranks Joint Progress Basic Program</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const g=i(s,[["render",o]]);export{h as __pageData,g as default};
